{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>On the donkey.</b> The designated donkey — the same donkey that Abraham saddled for the binding of Isaac, and the one upon which King Messiah is destined to be revealed, as it is said: ״עָנִי וְרֹכֵב עַל חֲמוֹר״ (Zechariah 9) (Pirkei deRabbi Eliezer 31)." "<b>And he returned to the land of Egypt, and Moses took the staff.</b> There is no strict sequence of earlier and later in Scripture."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:31.143944392Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}